DESCRIPTION:Reduce to 65km @ 128–177W (Z2 only\, no tempo blocks)\, ~195 
 min — flat terrain to keep HR controlled\n\nReason: Race is 8 days away 
 and sleep/body battery data show chronic under-recovery\; reducing ride vo
 lume protects freshness for the Oct 25 5K OW Swim without sacrificing aero
 bic stimulus.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-17
