SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Cap at 10–11km @ 6:45–7:00/km\, ~70
 –75 min — fully flat\, stop
DESCRIPTION:Cap at 10–11km @ 6:45–7:00/km\, ~70–75 min — fully flat
 \, stop if HR exceeds 160bpm\n\nReason: Back-to-back Saturday ride and Sun
 day run the week before the swim race adds unnecessary cumulative fatigue\
 ; a shorter\, relaxed run keeps the legs ticking without compromising race
 -week recovery.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-17
END:VEVENT
