DESCRIPTION:Cap at 15km @ 6:30–6:50/km (~100 min) — progressive build\,
  do not attempt 18.8km until consistent weekly run volume is re-establishe
 d post-race\n\nReason: Given the critically low run training volume over t
 he past 4 weeks\, jumping to 18.8km the week after a race creates a signif
 icant injury risk\; 15km is a safer progression toward the marathon base n
 eeded in 113 days.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-17
